  "helpQ1": "What is Hub Market?",
  "helpA1": "Hub Market is a marketplace that brings hundreds of verified local stores into one app — groceries, furniture, fashion, electronics and more, in one cart.",
  "helpQ2": "Who sells the products?",
  "helpA2": "Each product is sold and shipped by an independent store on Hub Market. The store's name is shown on every product, and you can visit its store page.",
  "helpQ3": "How are sellers verified?",
  "helpA3": "Every store is reviewed and approved by Hub Market before it can sell. Verified stores carry a Verified seller badge.",
  "helpQ4": "Can I order from several stores at once?",
  "helpA4": "Yes. Add products from any store to one cart and pay once — your order is split into one package per store.",
  "helpQ5": "How fast is delivery?",
  "helpA5": "Delivery times and fees depend on each store and your area; they are shown at checkout before you pay.",
  "helpQ6": "How can I pay?",
  "helpA6": "Cash on delivery, Visa and Mastercard. The options available for your order are shown at checkout.",
  "helpQ7": "Can I track my order?",
  "helpA7": "Yes. Open My orders to follow each package, or use Track order with your order number if you checked out as a guest.",
  "helpQ8": "Can I return or exchange products?",
  "helpA8": "Yes, within 14 days under our return policy. Start a return from the order, and the store will reply in the return's message thread.",
  "helpQ9": "How do I contact support?",
  "helpA9": "Our customer care team is available 24/7 on WhatsApp. You can also call a store directly from its store page.",
  "helpQ10": "Why shop on Hub Market?",
  "helpA10": "Verified sellers, secure payments, fast delivery and easy returns — with hundreds of local stores in one place.",
  "helpQOrders": "How can I track my order?",
  "helpAOrders": "Open Account → My Orders to see the status of each order.",
  "helpQPayments": "What payment methods do you accept?",
  "helpAPayments": "Cards via Network International, and Tabby (Pay in 4 / Pay Later) where available at checkout.",
  "helpQDelivery": "How fast is delivery?",
  "helpADelivery": "Free 3-hour delivery in Dubai, Sharjah & Ajman on orders over AED 150. The rest of the UAE is delivered within 24 hours.",
  "helpQReturns": "How do I return or exchange a product?",
  "helpAReturns": "Contact our support team within 14 days of delivery to arrange a return or exchange.",
  "helpQAuthentic": "Are all products 100% authentic?",
  "helpAAuthentic": "Yes. Every product is sourced from authorised distributors and is guaranteed 100% authentic.",
  "helpQLanguage": "How do I change the language?",
  "helpALanguage": "Use the EN / العربية toggle in the menu or in Settings.",
